# =============================================================================
# Cloudflare Pages — Security headers (Easy PDF Local)
# Formato: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# Contexto:
#   - SPA 100% client-side (Vite + React + PWA)
#   - GA4 (gtag) + Google AdSense + Funding Choices (CMP)
#   - Web Workers (pdfWorker) + pdf.js / pdf-lib (blob: / data:)
#   - Imagens de afiliados (Amazon, Mercado Livre, CDNs HTTPS)
#   - Google Fonts (Inter)
#
# Headers aplicados em /* :
#   X-Frame-Options DENY .............. anti-clickjacking
#   X-Content-Type-Options nosniff .... anti MIME sniffing
#   Referrer-Policy ................... não vaza path cross-origin
#   Permissions-Policy ................ desliga APIs sensíveis
#   Strict-Transport-Security ......... HSTS 1 ano + preload
#
# Content-Security-Policy (CSP) — diretivas:
#   default-src 'self'
#     Fallback: só mesma origem se uma diretiva faltar.
#
#   script-src
#     'self' + 'unsafe-inline' (snippets gtag/consent/AdSense no index.html;
#     nonce não usado em site estático puro).
#     Domínios: GTM, GA, pagead2, googleadservices, doubleclick, tpc,
#     fundingchoices (CMP), static.cloudflareinsights.com (CF Web Analytics).
#
#   style-src
#     'self' + 'unsafe-inline' (CSS Vite/Tailwind) + fonts.googleapis.com.
#
#   img-src
#     'self' data: blob: https: — previews PDF, ícones, OG, banners afiliados.
#
#   font-src
#     'self' data: fonts.gstatic.com — Inter e fontes embutidas.
#
#   connect-src
#     Beacons GA4 (analytics + region + wildcard *.google-analytics.com),
#     AdSense/DoubleClick/TPC, Funding Choices, ep1/ep2 ad traffic quality,
#     Cloudflare Insights + GTM (telemetria gtag).
#
#   frame-src
#     Iframes de anúncios, consent CMP e google.com.
#
#   worker-src / child-src
#     'self' blob: — Vite ?worker e pdf.js (sem isso o merge local quebra).
#
#   object-src 'none' | base-uri 'self' | form-action 'self' | frame-ancestors 'none'
#     Hardening clássico XSS / plugin / form hijack / framing.
#
#   media-src / manifest-src
#     PWA + blobs locais de mídia.
#
# Sem nonce por enquanto (complexidade em estático). Sem 'unsafe-eval' de
# propósito — se AdSense reclamar no console, avalie adicioná-lo como último recurso.
# =============================================================================

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com https://www.googleadservices.com https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://tpc.googlesyndication.com https://fundingchoicesmessages.google.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https://www.google-analytics.com https://region1.google-analytics.com https://analytics.google.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://tpc.googlesyndication.com https://fundingchoicesmessages.google.com https://ep1.adtrafficquality.google https://ep2.adtrafficquality.google https://cloudflareinsights.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://www.googletagmanager.com; frame-src 'self' https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://tpc.googlesyndication.com https://fundingchoicesmessages.google.com https://www.google.com https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; child-src 'self' blob:; media-src 'self' blob: data:; manifest-src 'self'

# =============================================================================
# PÓS-DEPLOY — checklist obrigatório
# 1) DevTools → Console: filtre "Content Security Policy" / "Refused to"
# 2) Teste Home, ferramenta PDF (upload + processar + preview) e Blog
# 3) Confirme AdSense (Network + slots) e GA4 Realtime (page_view / tool_view)
# 4) Se AdSense falhar com eval/script dinâmico, considere 'unsafe-eval' em
#    script-src (último recurso — alguns fluxos do AdSense ainda pedem)
# 5) Validadores: securityheaders.com · CSP Evaluator (Google)
# =============================================================================
